"grammar":[
{"title":"Ser vs. Estar：是 vs. 在／處於","intro":"介紹自己時，國籍、職業、性格用 ser；位置與暫時狀態用 estar。",
"verbs":["ser","estar"],
"compare":{"l":{"t":"Ser（本質）","pts":["國籍：Soy taiwanesa.","職業：Soy profesora.","性格外貌：Es simpático."]},
"r":{"t":"Estar（狀態／位置）","pts":["心情：Estoy cansada.","位置：Estoy en Tainan.","婚姻狀態：Está casado."]}}},
{"title":"形容詞性數配合","intro":"形容詞要跟著所形容的人事物變陰陽性：-o 結尾變 -a；-e／輔音結尾通常不變。",
"rules":["男生：Soy alto. ／ 女生：Soy alta.","陰陽同形：Soy joven / Es joven.","國籍：taiwanés → taiwanesa（去掉重音符號）","複數：加 -s 或 -es：altos, jóvenes"]}],
"patterns":[
{"title":"自我介紹","blocks":[{"t":"g","es":"Me llamo","zh":"我叫"},{"t":"n","es":"Ana","zh":"名字"},{"t":"f","es":"y","zh":"和"},{"t":"g","es":"soy","zh":"我是"},{"t":"a","es":"taiwanesa","zh":"台灣人"}],"ex":"Me llamo Ana y soy taiwanesa.","exzh":"我叫安娜，我是台灣人。"},
{"title":"介紹家人","blocks":[{"t":"f","es":"Mi","zh":"我的"},{"t":"n","es":"hermano","zh":"兄弟"},{"t":"g","es":"es","zh":"是"},{"t":"f","es":"muy","zh":"很"},{"t":"a","es":"alto","zh":"高"}],"ex":"Mi hermano es muy alto.","exzh":"我哥哥很高。"},
{"title":"說年齡與住處","blocks":[{"t":"g","es":"Tengo","zh":"我有"},{"t":"n","es":"veinticinco años","zh":"25 歲"},{"t":"f","es":"y","zh":"和"},{"t":"g","es":"vivo en","zh":"我住在"},{"t":"n","es":"Tainan","zh":"台南"}],"ex":"Tengo veinticinco años y vivo en Tainan.","exzh":"我二十五歲，住在台南。"}],
"output":{"title":"模擬寫作：自我介紹短文（約 35 字）","text":"Hola, **me llamo** Ana. **Soy taiwanesa** y **vivo** en Tainan. **Tengo veinticinco años**. **Mi familia** es pequeña: mi padre, mi madre y mi **hermana**. Soy **simpática** y **trabajo** en una escuela. ¡Un abrazo!","zh":"嗨，我叫安娜。我是台灣人，住在台南。我二十五歲。我的家庭很小：爸爸、媽媽和姊妹。我很親切，在學校工作。擁抱你！",
"traps":["年齡用 tener，不是 ser：Tengo 25 años（✗ Soy 25 años）。","國籍與職業在西文句中不用大寫：soy taiwanesa（✗ Taiwanesa）。","形容詞要配合性別：女生寫 simpática、alta，男生寫 simpático、alto。","Me llamo 後面直接接名字，不加 es：Me llamo Ana（✗ Me llamo es Ana）。"]}},
